      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weyauwega%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Menominee tribe was the prevalent group in the area when Europeans first settled the territory in the early 1840s.",
